{"version":1,"content":"<p>據Tom’s Hardware報道，<strong>AMD兩名高管近日對英偉達和Arm將新款處理器描述為「專為智能體AI設計」的説法提出質疑。</strong>AMD企業副總裁Madhu Rangarajan表示，晶片研發周期長達數年，AMD並未在四年前就預見智能體AI興起，再據此打造一款專用處理器。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585918.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T08:14:47.232762+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T07:40:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T08:08:07.419341+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T08:08:07.419341+00:00","content_hash":"d840eeabc94908df62e97863bf457058434441c247227a05190c16a3c85f394a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}